top to bottom direction
title Tactical DDD · Media identity / pre-adoption intake · 76282d3
class User <<supporting root>> $MEDIA {
 id: UUID
 email: str
 password_hash: str
 role: str
 created_at: datetime
}
class UploadReservation <<independent root candidate>> $MEDIA {
 id: UUID
 owner_id: UUID
 request_id: UUID
 request_hash: str
 asset_id: UUID
 key: str
 size_bytes: int
 version_id: str | None
 expires_at: datetime
 finalized_at: datetime | None
}
User "1" -right- "0..*" UploadReservation : owner_id only\n(local FK)
note bottom of User
  UNIQUE email; CHECK role in user/operator.
  auth.register()/login() + current_user():
  persisted identity / credential checks.
  Actor role is publisher; not User.role.
end note
note bottom of UploadReservation
  reserve(): UNIQUE(owner_id, request_id);
  finalize(): rechecks expiry under row lock;
  pin + new Asset + submit in one commit.
  CHECK ck_upload_reservations_finalized_has_pin.
end note
legend bottom
  Selected actual fields; no aggregate object collections or invented methods.
  Reservation exists before Asset: asset_id is unique but has NO Asset FK.
  By asset_id: reservation -> 0..1 eventual Asset; Asset -> 0..1 reservation.
  Selected source fields shown; full Source value is on the Asset view.
endlegend

@enduml
